  <div slot="title">The Nightwalkers</div>
  <p>The Nightwalkers are a villainous group that sells experiences using their powers. They are based in
  the south end of the city, in the night life districts. It is thought that their main income streams are
  drug dealing, prostitution and money laundering.</p>
  <p>Thanks to their public presence as entertainers, their powers are well known. They are not known to be
  actively hostile to civilians.</p>

  <h2>Known Members</h2>
  <h3>Sweet Agony</h3>
  <p>Sweet Agony wears a domino mask and simple red dress. After an observant journalist noted that the dress is
  one that H&M sells, H&M made a statement distancing the company from Sweet Agony.
  Following this, Sweet Agony released a statement distancing herself from H&M, saying "I only wear this shitty dress
  because it's cheap and my power rips everything I wear to shreds so I gotta buy a lot of 'em". She has continued wearing the dress.</p>
  <p>Sweet Agony is immune to injury. Parts of her body that sustain injuries temporarily transform into a red,
  scaly, spiny form with rippling muscles.</p>
  <p>Sweet Agony does weekly shows at her nightclub were people can pay money to harm her. For more information,
  see the website for <a href="#" class="neverVisited redLink">Club Agony</a>.</p>
  <h3>Mesmeriser</h3>
  <p>Mesmeriser wears a deep purple suit with spiralling black patterns covering it and a domino mask.</p>
  <p>Mesmeriser has the ability to put people into a trance through skin contact. While in a trance, subjects
  see visions of the near future, with longer contact showing more distant visions.</p>
  <p>Mesmeriser sells these services to the public, with 24 hours of contact giving visions up to 5 days into the future.
  For more information, see <a href="#" class="neverVisited redLink">Mesmeriser's website</a>.</p>
  <h3>Topshelf</h3>
  <p>Topshelf is a tinker specialising in beverages. He wears a bartender's outfit and a domino mask.
  For more information on what products he has available for sale,
  see the website for his bar, <a href="#" class="neverVisited redLink">Topshelf Bar</a>.</p>
</ParahumanWikiLayout>